------------------------------------------------------------------
|  Digital Research C READ.ME File Notes	        May 1984 |
|								 |
|								 |
|								 |
|	10. This and previous versions of DRC  do not  support	 |
|	    the enumeration data type.				 |
|								 |
|	11. When using the -f  switch for  compiling programs,   |
|	    functions returning a floating point value must be	 |
|           declared as 'double' instead of 'float'.		 |
|								 |
|	12. In addition to the I/O redirection operators < and	 |
|	    >,  the Run-time library functions now support the	 |
|           following features.					 |
|								 |
|	  o Strings enclosed in quotation marks are grouped as	 |
|           one argument.					 |
|								 |
|	  o Wildcard expansion.    All  argument  strings that	 |
|           contain a question mark  or  an  asterisk  and not	 |
|	    enclosed  in quotation  marks  are  wildcard  file	 |
|	    specifications.   Such an argument can be replaced	 |
|	    by all filenames in  the  current  directory  that	 |
|	    match the filespec.   The following  example lists	 |
|	    all files with a .c filetype.			 |
|								 |
|		echo  *.c					 |
|								 |
|	    If no files in the  directory  match  the wildcard	 |
|	    file  specification,   the   compiler  produces  a	 |
|	    message as shown below.				 |
|								 |
|	        *.c:  No match					 |
|								 |
|	  o Append to an  existing  file  operator,  >>.   The	 |
|	    following example demonstrates  the  use  of  this	 |
|	    operator.						 |
|								 |
|	        cat  file1 >  out.1				 |
|		cat  file2 >> out.1				 |
|								 |
|	    The preceeding statements  are equivalent  to  the	 |
|	    following statement.				 |
|								 |
|		cat  file1  file2  >  out.1			 |
|								 |
|								 |
|								 |
|				Page 3				 |
|								 |
